{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"w":0.052019405364990251,"c":1,"h":0.014830133479487362,"t":"Test 3","x":0.084716940829827003,"y":0.06235237509427427},{"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","w":0.26124567667643228,"x":0.084775085463551822,"y":0.11046511635042566,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1},{"h":0.01899401102139453,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","y":0.14825581398214316,"c":1,"x":0.084775075327488597,"w":0.71972320556640623},{"x":0.084775083626819972,"y":0.16715116249237416,"w":0.14532872517903644,"t":"Passage 2 below.","h":0.017593413820793935,"c":1},{"h":0.026242127361791434,"y":0.20783764829800244,"c":1,"t":"The problems of getting around the city of","w":0.60899653116861985,"x":0.14186851633891223},{"y":0.23827851675248202,"x":0.34775086863153526,"h":0.022043386983904845,"c":1,"t":"Dar es Salaam","w":0.19723182678222662},{"c":1,"w":0.69723185221354167,"t":"Dar es Salaam in Tanzania is one of the fastest growing cities in Africa. Its population","x":0.084775077298587478,"y":0.2819767439035219,"h":0.01753340308027207},{"h":0.017532386005633782,"y":0.30087209274119919,"c":1,"x":0.084775076019212275,"w":0.66608998616536452,"t":"has increased eightfold since 1980 and swells by half a million people every year."},{"c":1,"t":"United Nations projections anticipate it will become a megacity within seven years as","h":0.017585276556315366,"y":0.31831395370196036,"x":0.084775090602940112,"w":0.70242212931315107},{"y":0.33720930204376676,"t":"its population passes 10 million, reaching 13.4 million by 2035. Daniel Hoornweg for","c":1,"w":0.70069203694661453,"h":0.017584260149048792,"x":0.081314881101213529},{"c":1,"w":0.72145329793294277,"h":0.017441861023846261,"x":0.083044977288774177,"t":"the Global Cities Institute forecasts the city could be home to an incredible 73.7 million","y":0.35465116250514761},{"t":"people by 2100.","x":0.084775086296762656,"w":0.13667819976806639,"h":0.017441859689102501,"c":1,"y":0.37354651179789067},{"h":0.017598499861357531,"c":1,"t":"Today, four out of five of its people live in single-storey informal settlements on the","y":0.409727081811043,"w":0.68858133951822909,"x":0.083044970294394699},{"h":0.019053004687277886,"c":1,"y":0.42862141388374431,"t":"spreading edges of the city, where the journey to and from the centre regularly takes","x":0.083044976633594933,"w":0.70588236490885425},{"x":0.084685233663258683,"w":0.55032196044921877,"y":0.44486686723164892,"h":0.021421934358718309,"c":1,"t":"over two hours. It can be longer if rain turns the dirt roads to mud."},{"w":0.67993077596028639,"h":0.018948239993181515,"t":"Even in the middle of the day, traffic frequently slows to a stop without warning. It","y":0.48250524811167916,"c":1,"x":0.084775101660860053},{"t":"is not unusual for cars and minibuses to queue for 20 minutes at a key intersection.","w":0.68694534301757815,"y":0.49966805655219426,"x":0.08299474566948277,"h":0.021039964103298336,"c":1},{"x":0.083004890412063992,"y":0.51882384295790163,"w":0.71288319905598962,"h":0.020424071352660333,"t":"A single suburban rail line serves residents in a few areas to the south but is tiny in the","c":1},{"t":"context of the wider city. Outside the centre many rely on boda boda (motorbike taxis)","y":0.53778866324266228,"w":0.71972320556640623,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"x":0.084775075316772183},{"t":"to navigate the narrow side streets and potholed mud roads that make up much of the","w":0.72145329793294277,"y":0.55668299500448903,"c":1,"h":0.017494751574527623,"x":0.083044977310819848},{"w":0.37370241800944004,"h":0.018944171694628031,"c":1,"t":"metropolis. Their safety record is scandalous.","x":0.084775087102546387,"y":0.57412790677159298},{"w":0.69559280395507816,"h":0.02051693947687272,"c":1,"t":"Dar es Salaam's reliance on four arterial roads into the city is a legacy of the colonial","x":0.084733975386539928,"y":0.6101891240995776},{"w":0.64878890991210936,"h":0.017595448637442446,"y":0.62936046483328045,"x":0.084775095166133851,"t":"government that planned the city at the start of the 20th century to cater for a","c":1},{"t":"population of 35,000. Most of the current growth is made up of young people arriving","x":0.084716538125303872,"w":0.71290354410807288,"y":0.64630608463861172,"c":1,"h":0.02120841942607643},{"t":"from the countryside to find work, and as the population has exploded, Dar es Salaam","x":0.083044974070556346,"y":0.66569767444716543,"h":0.019046902239447827,"c":1,"w":0.71280278523763019},{"t":"has grown around those four highways. Nearly all the expansion is happening on the","w":0.6989619445800781,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"y":0.68459302297424118,"x":0.084775082985244499},{"w":0.62813654581705736,"h":0.021468233945404758,"t":"periphery, and nearly all takes place informally without any agreed strategy.","x":0.084710974452837942,"y":0.7011459425234019,"c":1},{"y":0.73786242091556209,"t":"But Dar es Salaam is pinning its hopes on a solution that could offer a different model","x":0.084727415225717098,"w":0.70944458007812494,"h":0.020086265094135025,"c":1},{"h":0.018989942722841158,"t":"for Africa's megacities, giving them an alternative to a future controlled by the private","y":0.75717284794120432,"w":0.71107264200846354,"x":0.083044993789103877,"c":1},{"h":0.017537471378825664,"y":0.77606718006071107,"t":"car. Unlike many cities on the continent, Dar es Salaam isn't trying to build a metro.","w":0.6885813395182292,"c":1,"x":0.084775074093042135},{"y":0.79496151182345809,"x":0.084775078585442101,"t":"It has chosen a less exciting but cheaper and more achievable method: the bus.","h":0.017538488453463952,"c":1,"w":0.65916956583658848},{"w":0.66621637980143233,"t":"The DART bus rapid transit (BRT) system runs on bus lanes separated from other","x":0.084715875815723027,"y":0.82901023326989187,"h":0.020876592818968254,"c":1},{"t":"traffic, mostly in the middle of the road to reduce stoppages. Ticket purchase","y":0.84883720933057916,"x":0.084775091961259888,"h":0.0189024689649685,"w":0.64013839721679688,"c":1},{"y":0.8644721148834702,"w":0.66794677734375008,"x":0.084724066408789961,"h":0.022180327675073941,"t":"and control takes place at stations prior to boarding and the buses are step-free,","c":1},{"w":0.67647059122721354,"x":0.084775085180949838,"h":0.017554762982421201,"t":"which means the entire route is accessible to people using wheelchairs or who are","c":1,"y":0.88517441831226973},{"y":0.90322665361360377,"h":0.021544110115964243,"c":1,"x":0.084595082780375988,"w":0.24256663004557294,"t":"travelling with baby buggies."},{"w":0.022491348584493004,"c":1,"h":0.014534882851794828,"y":0.96075581424270717,"t":"64","x":0.084775086970729274}]}